WEBVTT

00:01:57.871 --> 00:02:00.954
to avoid thinking deeply about what
this loss might actually mean.

00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:04.663
That's when I decided to
think about the house

00:02:04.663 --> 00:02:07.871
and trying to finish what he had
left before this event happened

00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:09.829
and he decided to help me.

00:02:12.288 --> 00:02:16.871
You know, strip old 100 year old
wallpaper and try to figure out

00:02:16.871 --> 00:02:22.371
the stained glass and started repairing
the floors of the attic space,

00:02:26.163 --> 00:02:29.496
three weeks turned to three months.